{
  "_comment": [
    "Shared contract for the waiting-on-you list: hook event semantics, marker",
    "shape, age labels, joining live registry rows to markers (dead pids dropped),",
    "and the focus plan layout.js already knows. Asserted by tests/waiting.test.js",
    "(lib/pure/waiting.js) and macos WaitingParityTests. Stop marks idle - the",
    "turn ended and the prompt is waiting - it does not clear. A marker counts",
    "only for the same pid AND session id (a reused pid never inherits one). A",
    "re-mark for the same session and reason keeps the previous at; expected.at",
    "absent means nowMs. WezTerm focuses a pane: without one it is the pid plan."
  ],
